deepml motion 0.3
module corpus.deepml_motion.example_01178
policy deterministic
policy no_network
skeleton Rig01178 { joint Root parent none joint Hip parent Root joint Knee parent Hip joint Foot parent Knee }
blend_tree Locomotion01178 parameter speed { idle at 0 walk at 1 run at 3 }
mask LowerBody { include [Hip, Knee, Foot] }
ik FootIK01178 chain [Hip, Knee, Foot] target GroundTarget iterations 10
